# Keep shared project trees visible to Codex and other tools that honor
# gitignore-style .ignore files. These negations override matching entries in
# .gitignore without changing what Git tracks.
!Live,*/
!Live,*/**
!Other/
!Other/**
!LIBRARY/
!LIBRARY/**
!dev/
!dev/**
!DONE/
!DONE/**
!Ref,*/
!Ref,*/**
